  "changed_since_previous": "Rebased and updated to handle cross-filesystem migrations using copy_file followed by cleanup instead of rename, adding dedicated functional test coverage for unwritable directories and separate filesystems.",
  "card": "This pull request hardens legacy-to-descriptor wallet migration against mid-process failures, unexpected exceptions, and filesystem permission errors. MigrateToSQLite now stages the SQLite database in a temporary location and writes records before deleting the original BerkeleyDB files, falling back gracefully without manual user intervention if creation fails. Broad exception handling is also added across migration steps to guarantee cleanup routines restore the original wallet from backup upon any failure. It directly touches wallet database conversion logic.",
